ext-align:right;vertical-align:middle"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">142,500&#160;</span></td><td style="padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:middle"/></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="display:none"/><td colspan="3" style="display:none"/><td colspan="3" style="display:none"/></tr></table></div><div style="height:49.68pt;position:relative;width:100%"><div style="bottom:0;position:absolute;width:100%"><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">38</span></div></div></div><hr style="page-break-after:always"/><div style="min-height:49.68pt;width:100%"><div><span><br/></span></div></div><div><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:2.650%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:95.150%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><div style="margin-top:2pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:5.2pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%;position:relative;top:-2.8pt;vertical-align:baseline">(1)</span></div></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">Based on the closing price of the Company&#8217;s common stock on the Nasdaq on December&#160;31, 2025, which was $3.80.</span></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><div style="margin-top:2pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:5.2pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%;position:relative;top:-2.8pt;vertical-align:baseline">(2)</span></div></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:justify;vertical-align:top"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">On July 15, 2025, the Company granted Mr. Stinchcomb 600,000 restricted stock units with tandem dividend equivalent rights under the Plan. The restricted stock units granted are performance-based, subject to the Company achieving certain stock price or financial performance goals. The restricted stock units will vest upon the date the Board determines that the common stock achieves a 10-day VWAP of $7.50, or the Company achieves 40% revenue growth and 35% adjusted free cash flow growth for the full year 2025 compared to 2024. These restricted stock units vested on March 10, 2026.</span></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><div style="margin-top:2pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:5.2pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%;position:relative;top:-2.8pt;vertical-align:baseline">(3) </span></div></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:justify;vertical-align:top"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">On July 15, 2025, the Company granted Mr. Stinchcomb 600,000 restricted stock units with tandem dividend equivalent rights under the Plan. The restricted stock units granted are performance-based, subject to the Company achieving certain stock price or financial performance goals. The restricted stock units will vest upon the date the Board determines that the common stock achieves a 10-day VWAP of $9.50.</span></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:5.2pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%;position:relative;top:-2.8pt;vertical-align:baseline">(4)</span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"> </span></div></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:justify;vertical-align:top"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">On July 15, 2025, the Company granted Mr. Stinchcomb 600,000 restricted stock units with tandem dividend equivalent rights under the Plan. The restricted stock units granted are performance-based, subject to the Company achieving certain stock price or financial performance goals. The restricted stock units will vest upon the date the Board determines that the common stock achieves a 10-day VWAP of $11.50.</span></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><div style="margin-top:2pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:5.2pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%;position:relative;top:-2.8pt;vertical-align:baseline">(5)</span></div></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:justify;vertical-align:top"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">On July 25, 2025, the Company granted Mr. Hayden 17,500 restricted stock units under the Plan. The restricted stock units granted are performance-based, subject to the Company achieving certain stock price goals. The RSUs granted will vest upon the date the Board determines that the common stock of the Company achieves a 10-day VWAP of $6.50. In the event that the performance condition is not met, the RSUs will vest on the first anniversary of the grant date.</span></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><div style="margin-top:2pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:5.2pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%;position:relative;top:-2.8pt;vertical-align:baseline">(6)</span></div></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:justify;vertical-align:top"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">On July 25, 2025, the Company granted Mr. Hayden 17,500 restricted stock units under the Plan. The restricted stock units granted are performance-based, subject to the Company achieving certain stock price goals. The RSUs granted will vest upon the date the Board determines that the common stock of the Company achieves a 10-day VWAP of $7.50. In the event that the performance condition is not met, the RSUs will vest on the second anniversary of the grant date.</span></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><div style="margin-top:2pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:5.2pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%;position:relative;top:-2.8pt;vertical-align:baseline">(7)</span></div></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:justify;vertical-align:top"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">On July 25, 2025, the Company granted Ms. Hayden 17,500 restricted stock units under the Plan. The restricted stock units granted are performance-based, subject to the Company achieving certain stock price goals. The RSUs granted will vest upon the date the Board determines that the common stock of the Company achieves a 10-day VWAP of $9.50. In the event that the performance condition is not met, the RSUs will vest on the third anniversary of the grant date.</span></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><div style="margin-top:2pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:5.2pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%;position:relative;top:-2.8pt;vertical-align:baseline">(8)</span></div></td><td colspan="3" style="padding